### HabitController HTTP Client
### IntelliJ HTTP Client for testing HabitController endpoints

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@contentType = application/json
@userId = 1
# Test users from data.sql:
# userId=1: test@example.com (password: "password")
# userId=2: admin@example.com (password: "password")
# userId=3: user@example.com (password: "password")

### Create Habit (POST /api/v1/habits)
POST {{baseUrl}}/habits?userId={{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Morning Meditation",
  "description": "Meditate for 10 minutes every morning",
  "tags": "health,mindfulness",
  "star": true,
  "periodType": "D",
  "periodCount": 1,
  "targetCount": 30
}

###

### Create Habit - Minimal Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/habits?userId={{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Read Books"
}

###

### Create Habit - Invalid Title (should return validation error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/habits?userId={{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "This should fail"
}

###

### Get All Habits for User (GET /api/v1/habits)
GET {{baseUrl}}/habits?userId={{userId}}

###

### Get Specific Habit (GET /api/v1/habits/{id})
GET {{baseUrl}}/habits/1?userId={{userId}}

###

### Update Habit (PUT /api/v1/habits/{id})
PUT {{baseUrl}}/habits/1?userId={{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Evening Meditation",
  "description": "Meditate for 15 minutes every evening",
  "tags": "health,mindfulness,evening",
  "star": false,
  "periodType": "D",
  "periodCount": 1,
  "targetCount": 60
}

###

### Archive Habit (PATCH /api/v1/habits/{id}/archive)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/habits/1/archive?userId={{userId}}

###

### Delete Habit (DELETE /api/v1/habits/{id})
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/habits/1?userId={{userId}}

###

### Expected Response Formats:
### POST - Status: 201 Created, Location: /api/v1/habits/{id}, Body: {"id": {habit_id}}
### GET (list) - Status: 200 OK, Body: [{habit1}, {habit2}, ...]
### GET (single) - Status: 200 OK, Body: {habit}
### PUT - Status: 204 No Content
### PATCH - Status: 204 No Content
### DELETE - Status: 204 No Content